  m_Name: DeNiro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: DeNiro, The Robber
  descriptionEnglish: Rabbit DeNiro is a cute white rabbit with a troubled past as
    a former bank robber. Motivated by a deep fear of hell and a desire for redemption,
    he now hunts demons, striving to make amends for his sins and secure a place
    in heaven. His adorable exterior masks a determined and courageous spirit on
    a mission to avoid a fiery fate.
  nameChinese: "\u5C0F\u5C3C\u8BFA, \u5F3A\u76D7"
  descriptionChinese: "\u5C0F\u5C3C\u8BFA\u662F\u4E00\u53EA\u53EF\u7231\u7684\u767D\u8272\u5154\u5B50\uFF0C\u66FE\u7ECF\u662F\u5012\u9709\u7684\u94F6\u884C\u52AB\u532A\u3002\u7531\u4E8E\u5BF9\u5730\u72F1\u6DF1\u6DF1\u7684\u6050\u60E7\u548C\u5BF9\u6551\u8D4E\u7684\u6E34\u671B\uFF0C\u4ED6\u73B0\u5728\u730E\u6740\u6076\u9B54\uFF0C\u52AA\u529B\u5F25\u8865\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u7F6A\u884C\uFF0C\u4E89\u53D6\u5728\u5929\u5802\u627E\u5230\u4E00\u4E2A\u5B89\u8EAB\u4E4B\u5904\u3002\u4ED6\u53EF\u7231\u7684\u5916\u8868\u63A9\u76D6\u4E86\u4ED6\u575A\u5B9A\u800C\u52C7\u6562\u7684\u5185\u5FC3\uFF0C\u4ED6\u5C06\u9762\u5BF9\u707C\u70ED\u7684\u547D\u8FD0\u3002"
  namePortuguese: DeNiro, O Assaltante
  descriptionPortuguese: "Rabbit DeNiro \xE9 um coelho branco fofo com um passado
    problem\xE1tico como ex-assaltante de banco. Motivado por um profundo medo do
    inferno e um desejo de reden\xE7\xE3o, ele agora ca\xE7a dem\xF4nios, buscando
    reparar seus pecados e assegurar um lugar no para\xEDso. Sua apar\xEAncia ador\xE1vel
    esconde um esp\xEDrito determinado e corajoso em uma miss\xE3o para evitar um
    destino ardente."
  nameSpanish: "DeNiro, El Ladr\xF3n"
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Rabbit DeNiro es un lindo conejo blanco con un pasado
    problem\xE1tico como antiguo ladr\xF3n de bancos. Motivado por un profundo miedo
    al infierno y el deseo de redenci\xF3n, ahora caza demonios, esforz\xE1ndose
    por enmendar sus pecados y asegurar un lugar en el cielo. Su exterior adorable
    oculta un esp\xEDritu decidido y valiente en una misi\xF3n para evitar un destino
    ardiente"
  shortName: DeNiro
